      "data": {
        "value": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>MINIMAL RESIDUAL DISEASE (MRD) ANALYSIS FOR B-ALL</strong></p>\n<table class=\"cke_show_border\" style=\"width: 99%; height: 162.4px; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 20.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 43.2588%; padding: 1px;\"><strong>Clinical history</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 56.2059%; padding: 1px;\">K/C/O B-acute lymphoblastic leukemia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 20.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 43.2588%; padding: 1px;\"><strong>Specimen</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 56.2059%; padding: 1px;\">Bone Marrow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 20.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 43.2588%; padding: 1px;\"><strong>Instrument software</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 56.2059%; padding: 1px;\">BD FACS LYRIC/BD FACS SUITE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 20.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 43.2588%; padding: 1px;\"><strong>Gating strategy</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 56.2059%; padding: 1px;\">10 colour FCM using CD 45 gating.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 20.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 43.2588%; padding: 1px;\"><strong>Cell preparation method</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 56.2059%; padding: 1px;\">Stain - Lyse - Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 40px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 43.2588%; padding: 1px;\"><strong>Number of Events Acquired</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 56.2059%; padding: 1px;\">1026060</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 20.4px;\">\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 43.2588%; padding: 1px;\"><strong>FSC SSC Viable events</strong></td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"width: 56.2059%; padding: 1px;\">905382</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Descriptive summary:</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>Flow cytometric immunophenotypic analysis of the bone marrow was done on CD45/side scatter plots. A total of<br>10.20 lac events were acquired. Populations of normal lymphocytes and granulocytes are seen.<br><br>CD19 gating and further hierarchial analysis shows predominantly normal mature B-cells and few plasma cells.<br><br><strong>Minimal residual disease not detected.</strong></p>",
        "field": "textEditor"
